<title>USA: MidAmerican Energy awarded power contract.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican Energy awarded power contract.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidAmerican Energy Co said Wednesday it won a contract to provide electricity for the Resale Power Group of Iowa, which includes 27 municipal utilities, one rural electric cooperative and an investor-owned utility.</p>
<p>The five-year contract begins on January 1, 1999.</p>
<p>The Resale Power Group members serve nearly 27,000 residential, commercial and industrial customers, and purchase about 500,000 megawatt hours per year. Electricity to the utilities presently is supplied by IES Utilities Inc.</p>
<p>	    ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
